=2 Walkthrough
* Check the **Transcendental Radiance** in {p:Empyreal Paradox} and enter the battlefield "{M:The Winds of Time|The Winds of Time|The Winds of Time}".
* You will have to fight and defeat {m:Metus}.
** {m:Metus} can use {m:Promathia}'s TP moves, including : **Bastion of Twilight**, **Wheel of Impregnability**, **Infernal Deliverance**, **Empty Salvation**.
** {m:Metus} can also use **Osmotic Wave**, **Censure**.
** {m:Metus} can cast {s:Meteor}.
** {p:Trust} NPCs can be used for this battle.
* After winning the battle, a cutscene will start along with the next Mission.

=2 Notes
* Upon failure, return to {p:Reisenjima Sanctorium} and click the **Reisen Crystal**, agree to meet the Goddess and you will return to {p:Empyreal Paradox} for a cutscene with {m:Metus}. After head into the room with the "Transendental Radiance" and there is a "Dimensional Portal" to the right of the entrance, use this to return to {p:Reisenjima Sanctorium}.
* Then click the "Reisenjima Crystal", agree to meet the Goddess again and you will be given the {@k} {k:Extradimensional scar} required to attempt the fight again.
** This capability is lost when you're no longer on a RoV mission requiring access to {p:Empyreal Paradox}.
** If you haven't reached {p:Dawn} in {p:Chains of Promathia}, you will be confined to the basement. There are no free trips to {z:Al'Taieu}.
* The **Reisen Crystal** in {p:Reisenjima Sanctorium} will also teleport you to {p:Empyreal Paradox}.

